  "description": "A demon from the underworld possessing a human?! \n\nBella, the demon and monarch of the underworld, is possessed by the villainess Isabella Dunkeld, hated by her family and pointed at by everyone as a villainess. 'How did I end up in this body?' She has no memory of making a contract with the human Isabella, and when she came to, she was trapped in Isabella's body with all her powers sealed. She decides to act like a 'human' for the time being, but...\n\n *\"So how many people have I killed with these hands? Hundreds? Thousands?\"\n\n\"Huh... You didn't kill a single person?\"\n\n\"You're calling me a villainess when you didn't kill a single person?\"*\n\nThe demon Bella really finds humans difficult...\n\n(Source: Kakaopage, translated)",
